{"seq":2,"slug":"water-pollution-eutrophication","title":"水体污染与富营养化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/pollution-remediation/pollution-by-sphere/water-pollution-eutrophication","wordCount":1932,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"水体污染与富营养化\">水体污染与富营养化</h1><p>一条河可以同时被两种逻辑完全相反的污染折磨：一种是有机物太多，微生物分解时把水里的氧耗光，鱼虾窒息；另一种是营养太多，藻类疯长爆发，最后死亡腐烂又把氧耗光。前者是&quot;脏&quot;，后者是&quot;太肥&quot;，但殊途同归地指向同一个结局——缺氧的死水。水污染最特殊的地方在于它有流域尺度：污染随水流走，上游排放下游受害，治理必须算整个流域的总量。这一篇聚焦水体这个圈层的两大污染主线——耗氧污染与富营养化，迁移扩散的通用规律仍调用 <a href=\"../pollution-foundations/fate-and-transport\">污染物在环境中的迁移转化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>水体污染指污染物进入水体使其水质恶化、超出自净能力、损害用途或生态的现象。衡量水污染最核心的不是某种具体化学物质，而是&quot;水里还剩多少氧&quot;——因为溶解氧是水生生态的生命线。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  ORG[有机污染物排入&lt;br/&gt;生活污水 工业废水] --&gt; DECOMP[微生物分解]&#10;  DECOMP --&gt; CONSUME[消耗溶解氧&lt;br/&gt;BOD/COD 升高]&#10;  NUT[氮磷营养盐排入&lt;br/&gt;农业面源 污水] --&gt; ALGAE[藻类大量繁殖]&#10;  ALGAE --&gt; BLOOM[水华/赤潮]&#10;  BLOOM --&gt; DIE[藻类死亡]&#10;  DIE --&gt; DECOMP&#10;  CONSUME --&gt; HYPOX[水体缺氧&lt;br/&gt;溶解氧耗尽]&#10;  HYPOX --&gt; DEAD[死亡区&lt;br/&gt;鱼类死亡 生态崩溃]&#10;  ALGAE --&gt;|某些藻种| TOXIN[藻毒素&lt;br/&gt;威胁饮用水]\">flowchart TD\n  ORG[有机污染物排入&lt;br/&gt;生活污水 工业废水] --&gt; DECOMP[微生物分解]\n  DECOMP --&gt; CONSUME[消耗溶解氧&lt;br/&gt;BOD/COD 升高]\n  NUT[氮磷营养盐排入&lt;br/&gt;农业面源 污水] --&gt; ALGAE[藻类大量繁殖]\n  ALGAE --&gt; BLOOM[水华/赤潮]\n  BLOOM --&gt; DIE[藻类死亡]\n  DIE --&gt; DECOMP\n  CONSUME --&gt; HYPOX[水体缺氧&lt;br/&gt;溶解氧耗尽]\n  HYPOX --&gt; DEAD[死亡区&lt;br/&gt;鱼类死亡 生态崩溃]\n  ALGAE --&gt;|某些藻种| TOXIN[藻毒素&lt;br/&gt;威胁饮用水]</pre><p>下表区分两类水污染指标，它们衡量的是不同问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>衡量什么</th>\n<th>升高意味着</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>生化需氧量</td>\n<td>可被微生物降解的有机物量</td>\n<td>耗氧型有机污染重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>化学需氧量</td>\n<td>可被化学氧化的总还原性物质</td>\n<td>有机+难降解污染重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DO</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>溶解氧</td>\n<td>水中可供呼吸的氧</td>\n<td>越低生态越危险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TN/TP</td>\n<td>总氮/总磷</td>\n<td>营养盐含量</td>\n<td>富营养化风险高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"耗氧污染-溶解氧的生死线\">耗氧污染：溶解氧的生死线</h2><p>生活污水和食品、造纸等工业废水里含有大量可降解有机物。这些有机物本身未必有毒，但微生物分解它们时要消耗氧——有机物越多，耗氧越剧烈。这种污染用生化需氧量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量，它表示微生物在一定条件下分解水样中有机物所需的氧量；化学需氧量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 则用强氧化剂测量所有可氧化物质，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 测不到的难降解部分。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 通常大于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>，两者比值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD/COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 还能反映污染物的可生化性——比值高说明适合生物处理，这直接关系到 <a href=\"../remediation-governance/bioremediation\">生物修复</a> 和污水生化处理工艺的选择。</p>\n<p>水体有一定自净能力：排入有机物后溶解氧先下降，随着有机物被分解和大气复氧，溶解氧又逐渐回升，沿河形成一条&quot;氧垂曲线&quot;。但当排污强度超过自净能力，溶解氧降到临界值（一般认为低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\ mg/L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为缺氧）以下，鱼类和好氧生物就无法存活，水体进入黑臭状态。这条溶解氧的生死线，是判断河流健康最直接的指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"富营养化-太肥的水如何变成死水\">富营养化：太肥的水如何变成死水</h2><p>富营养化（eutrophication）是当代水污染最棘手的问题，它的吊诡之处在于：罪魁不是有毒物，而是植物营养——氮和磷。湖泊、水库、近海本来需要氮磷维持生态，但当浓度过高时，藻类和浮游植物失去限制疯狂繁殖，水面被绿色（淡水蓝藻）或红褐色（海洋赤潮）藻华覆盖。</p>\n<p>富营养化的危害是分阶段释放的。藻华初期遮蔽阳光、杀死沉水植物；藻类死亡后，分解过程大量耗氧，造成水底缺氧形成&quot;死亡区&quot;；某些蓝藻和甲藻还会释放藻毒素（如微囊藻毒素），直接威胁饮用水安全和人类健康。</p>\n<p>控制富营养化的关键是识别&quot;限制性营养元素&quot;——根据利比希最小因子定律，藻类生长受最稀缺的那种营养限制。淡水系统通常磷是限制因子，海洋系统常是氮。这决定了治理优先削减哪种元素：对多数湖泊，控磷比控氮更有效率。</p>\n<p>氮磷主要来自农业非点源（化肥流失、畜禽粪污）和生活污水，其中农业面源是最难管的部分（非点源概念见 <a href=\"../pollution-foundations/pollutant-types-sources\">污染物类型与来源</a>）。这是一个全球性失衡：根据欧洲环境署与联合国环境规划署 2025 年 1 月报告，欧洲农业输入的氮磷已超出生态系统自然吸收能力的 30% 至 50%，持续驱动土壤和水体富营养化（来源：IAEA，<a href=\"https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/linking-nutrient-fluxes-eutrophication-and-harmful-algal-blooms）。氮磷循环也是地球系统科学认定已突破&quot;行星边界&quot;安全区的环节之一。\">https://www.iaea.org/newscenter/news/linking-nutrient-fluxes-eutrophication-and-harmful-algal-blooms）。氮磷循环也是地球系统科学认定已突破&quot;行星边界&quot;安全区的环节之一。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"流域尺度-为什么水污染要算总量\">流域尺度：为什么水污染要算总量</h2><p>水污染区别于大气和土壤污染的核心特征，是它的方向性和累积性——水往低处流，把上游所有污染累积带到下游。这意味着单看某个排放口达标毫无意义，必须看整条河、整个流域能承受多少污染。</p>\n<p>由此产生了&quot;水环境容量&quot;和&quot;总量控制&quot;的概念：先估算一个水体在保证目标水质前提下能容纳的污染物最大量（即环境容量），再把这个容量分配给流域内所有排放源。这套逻辑与大气治理的&quot;区域协同&quot;异曲同工（见 <a href=\"air-pollution-control\">大气污染与治理</a>），但水的方向性使上下游的责任与利益冲突更尖锐——上游治污、下游受益，需要生态补偿等制度来平衡，这类制度设计属于 <a href=\"../remediation-governance/pollution-policy-circular-economy\">污染防治政策与循环经济</a> 的范畴。</p>\n<p>环境容量的估算本质上是一个质量平衡问题：稳态下，排入量等于降解量加输出量。对一级降解的污染物，可写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>V</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q\\,C_{in} = Q\\,C_{out} + k\\,V\\,C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是流量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是水体体积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是降解速率常数。这个简单平衡是流域水质管理所有复杂模型的内核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新兴水污染与饮用水安全\">新兴水污染与饮用水安全</h2><p>传统水污染指标（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、氮磷）管的是&quot;看得见&quot;的污染，但越来越多的关注转向痕量的新兴污染物——它们浓度极低却危害特殊。药物残留、个人护理品、全氟化合物（PFAS）、微塑料正大量进入水体，常规污水处理厂对它们去除效果有限。</p>\n<p>这些物质的环境行为和治理挑战属于专门章节：PFAS 和内分泌干扰物见 <a href=\"../emerging-pollutants/emerging-contaminants-edcs\">新污染物与内分泌干扰物</a>，微塑料见 <a href=\"../emerging-pollutants/pops-and-microplastics\">持久性有机污染物与微塑料</a>。这里只强调它们对饮用水标准的冲击：欧盟自 2026 年 1 月 12 日起对饮用水强制执行 PFAS 限值，并正推动把微塑料纳入饮用水指令的&quot;观察清单&quot;（来源：欧盟委员会，<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/news/new-eu-rules-limit-pfas-drinking-water-2026-01-12_en）。这标志着水质管理正从控制宏量污染物，转向应对痕量但持久的健康威胁。\">https://environment.ec.europa.eu/news/new-eu-rules-limit-pfas-drinking-water-2026-01-12_en）。这标志着水质管理正从控制宏量污染物，转向应对痕量但持久的健康威胁。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>水污染的核心指标是溶解氧，耗氧污染（高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>）和富营养化最终都导向同一结局：缺氧死水。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 测可降解有机物，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 测全部可氧化物，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BOD/COD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 比值反映可生化性，决定生物处理工艺选择。</li>\n<li>富营养化的元凶是氮磷而非毒物；控制要先识别限制性营养元素（淡水多为磷，海洋多为氮），优先削减最稀缺的那种。</li>\n<li>水污染有流域尺度，必须用&quot;环境容量+总量控制&quot;算总账；上游治污下游受益的矛盾需生态补偿等制度平衡。</li>\n<li>新兴痕量污染物（PFAS、微塑料、药物残留）常规工艺难去除，正推动饮用水标准从控宏量转向防痕量持久威胁。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水体污染与富营养化","id":"水体污染与富营养化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"耗氧污染：溶解氧的生死线","id":"耗氧污染-溶解氧的生死线"},{"level":2,"text":"富营养化：太肥的水如何变成死水","id":"富营养化-太肥的水如何变成死水"},{"level":2,"text":"流域尺度：为什么水污染要算总量","id":"流域尺度-为什么水污染要算总量"},{"level":2,"text":"新兴水污染与饮用水安全","id":"新兴水污染与饮用水安全"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大气污染与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/pollution-remediation/pollution-by-sphere/air-pollution-control"},"next":{"title":"土壤污染与重金属","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/pollution-remediation/pollution-by-sphere/soil-contamination-heavy-metals"}}